flowchart TD
    START([Start]) --> INPUT[/Message found; conversation C; self S; admin A/]
    INPUT --> EXISTS{C: conversation exists?}
    EXISTS -->|False| DENY[/404 Message not found/]
    EXISTS -->|True| ACCESS{S OR A?}
    ACCESS -->|False| DENY
    ACCESS -->|True| CONTINUE[/Continue to sender check and feedback handling/]
    DENY --> STOP([Stop])
    CONTINUE --> STOP
